From ae95b5c5ee62c1b37e2ed026ee8fc4e0b0aa4aa4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sayzal28 <Sayzal28@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 21:52:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] New avatar-set outfits are saved with labels and a clean
 name

The Studio saves a new race outfit with a picture and a name made from the typed
words, and no labels. Now the European picture gets the same two AI reads as a
Studio clothes picture (its name, then the picture), the African picture and each
race plate copy the European row's labels, and a franchise or brand name the word
list knows is taken out of the saved name. A label read that gives nothing is
logged as clothes.labels failed (it was silent); the outfit is still saved.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
